    rdfs:comment """Cluster OSAT/IDM Backend - Covers assembly, packaging, and final test of chips—everything after wafer fab—spanning wafer bumping/singulation, die attach/wirebond/flip-chip, molding, substrate attach, advanced packaging and system-level/final test. Includes pure-play OSATs that provide outsourced 
services as well as IDMs/foundries with in-house/contracted back-end capacity""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Industrial_Alliance_Supply_Chain_Cluster .

