    rdfs:comment "Cluster SiFo/IDM Frontend - Covers silicon foundries and integrated device manufacturers from 100 to 300 millimeter wafer process, from front-end transistor formation to back-end interconnect, including lithography, deposition, etching, ion implantation and diffusion, cleaning, and chemical mechanical polishing." ;
